// Accept twin of reject/E-BIND-NOTE/noted-key-never-noted.ron: `Noted` reads
// a key a preceding writer in the same Sequence introduced [CR#607.2]. The
// writer is a `ChooseAndNote(_, Number)` so the domain matches the reader
// too (a `Noting` stores Objects and would trip E-KIND-NOTE-DOMAIN instead).
Normal(
  name: "Accept Noted Key Bound",
  types: [Sorcery],
  abilities: [
    Spell(effect: Sequence([
      By(You, ChooseAndNote("Stashed", Number)),
      Draw(Noted("Stashed")),
    ])),
  ],
)
